    title: "How Are Foundations Designed for El Paso Desert Soil?",
    description: "El Paso desert foundations are engineered from borings that map collapsible windblown soil and caliche, with compacted select fill and strict moisture control.",
    h1: "How Are Foundations Designed for El Paso Desert Soil?",
